// testrun69 (Al 6061, T0=300K) pore-formation collage: protrusion ->
// contact -> approaching pinch-off -> pinch-off / two pores.
// Reproduces the figure first built by the one-off _render_collage_panels.sh
// + _build_cutaway_collage_v1.py (collage_v4: velocity + rays + section flow).
// Copy this file as the starting point for a new case; see
// README_cutaway_collage.md for what every key does.
//
// Units: z in mm (scan direction), y in um as an offset from the nominal
// flat surface (negative = above it / gas side, positive = into the metal).
// "at"/"label_at" positions are axes fractions of the panel: [0,0] =
// bottom-left corner, [1,1] = top-right.
